OL,3,GNEWSACouncil blocks demolition of
OL,4,A'landmark' mill
OL,5,
OL,6,FPlans to demolish part of a 19th
OL,7,FCentury mill in Bronte Country have
OL,8,Fbeen refused after conservation
OL,9,Fofficers said part of the site should
OL,10,Fbe protected.
OL,12,FAn application to demolish sections of
OL,13,FVale Mill, a short distance from
OL,14,FOakworth Station, had been submitted to
OL,15,FBradford Council as part of proposals
OL,16,Fto redevelop the site for housing.
OL,18,FWhile it stated that a Grade II listed
OL,19,Fsection of the mill would have been
OL,20,Fretained and converted, the plans also
OL,21,Fincluded the demolition of an unlisted
OL,22,Ffour-storey building.
OL,23,APub: 28-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,383,380,200,160,0,100
