OL,3,GNEWSACouncil blocks demolition of
OL,4,A'landmark' mill
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe council's conservation officer, Jon
OL,7,FAckroyd, said the building was a
OL,8,F"landmark presence" that should be
OL,9,Ftreated as part of the wider listed
OL,10,Fmill complex.
